  "description": "Consistent-hash sharding for SetNet clusters: a ShardRing with virtual nodes maps any key (room code, region, player id) to the node that owns it; every server answers directory queries (server.UseSharding) and clients ask any node where a key lives (client.UseSharding().LocateAsync) then connect there. Runtime membership updates via UpdateNodes. Depends only on SetNet.",
